        "gmNotes": "<p><strong>Example: Research.</strong> Built for four level-3 PCs: base DC 18. The party searches a half-flooded abbey's archive for where the abbot hid the reliquary.</p><p>Each round is one day, and the party has five before the bishop's agents arrive. Each PC can research one area a day.</p><p><strong>Each roll:</strong> a success gains 1 RP and a critical success 2. Use + on the area's RP Gathered and on Research Points. A critical failure loses 1 Research Point only. Mark an area Complete when it is full.</p><p><strong>Thresholds:</strong> Research Points thresholds tick as the points rise. Reveal each one fully when it's reached.</p><p><strong>Days:</strong> the timed events are hidden thresholds on Days. Reveal each when it happens.</p>",
